{"id":45,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"仏教精神と探究で輝く女性を育む","feature_description":"京都光華中学校・高等学校は、仏教精神に基づく教育を大切にし、心の成長と学力の伸長を両立する女子校です。中高一貫の学びの中で、英語、探究、ICT、行事や部活動を通して主体性と表現力を育てます。一人ひとりが自分のよさを見つけ、周囲と協働しながら未来へ踏み出す力を養います。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":624,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":625,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":626,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":627,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":628,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":629,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":630,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":631,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":632,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":633,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":634,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":635,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":636,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":637,"name":"箏曲部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.koka.ac.jp/schoollife/clu